From 150369ae897cda2ed8f1dd994e930724bfd732a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:13:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] #483 step 8b: the loader's workflows prefer the bundle's
 aisdlc gate commands

Each bundle script or native tool call now runs the verified bundle's
bin/<os>-<arch>/aisdlc gate <name> with the same arguments. One probe per
bundle (the exact `aisdlc gate` usage line) picks it; an older bundle keeps
the original path until step 8c.

Written-by: codex
